    "score": 4,
    "reason": "Generally logical sectioning with quick start first and advanced topics later, though the all-in-one title is mixed with compose recommendations and a few advanced sections could be better sequenced."
  },
  "clarity": {
    "score": 3,
    "reason": "Most commands and explanations are precise, but there are inconsistencies such as mismatched offline archive filenames, an incorrect npm example, and inconsistent expected service outputs."
  },
  "understandability": {
    "score": 3,
    "reason": "The quick start is straightforward, but the guide assumes familiarity with Docker, reverse proxies, TLS, S3/NFS, and advanced security concepts without much explanation."
  }
